  {
   "text": "On top, the wind went straight through.",
   "start": 4.045,
   "end": 6.02
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: a warm layer needs a wind-blocking one over it, or one jacket that does both.",
   "start": 6.27,
   "end": 11.794
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your cold hike.",
   "start": 12.044,
   "end": 13.76
  }
